        "pl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "bdbfb1ef-33a9-3b32-905e-a3ac26f2eacf",
                "word": "gdzieniegdzie",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f3e9691a-9ec8-35b8-95c6-16fcd867df91",
                        "entry_id": "bdbfb1ef-33a9-3b32-905e-a3ac26f2eacf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "w niektórych miejscach"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32380f82-1f3b-4e1b-8113-e95d18f0ccd3",
                                "sense_id": "f3e9691a-9ec8-35b8-95c6-16fcd867df91",
                                "text": "Deszcz przestał nareszcie padać i tylko gdzieniegdzie pozostały spore kałuże"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8903c19f-6bf0-4ce6-8d6d-59f5339bec71",
                        "source_entry_id": "bdbfb1ef-33a9-3b32-905e-a3ac26f2eacf",
                        "source_sense_id": "f3e9691a-9ec8-35b8-95c6-16fcd867df91",
                        "target_lang_word": "here and there",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "here and there",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                        "entry_id": "e53b4e82-54f7-3098-ac7b-3ce75316907f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In, at or to various places; in one place and another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efd720bf-0e1c-4931-aa51-c377796e2f29",
                                                "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                                "text": "Thus, when he drew up instructions in lawyer language […] his clerks […] understood him very well. If he had written a love letter, or a farce, or a ballade, or a story, no one, either clerks, or friends, or compositors, would have understood anything but a word here and a word there."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ceea0430-467c-43cc-a1a8-8abaca956bf9",
                                                "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                                "text": "They thanked him and bade him good-bye, and turned toward the West, walking over fields of soft grass dotted here and there with daisies and buttercups."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95aa4014-b384-41cd-bd31-d9ccd1670e1f",
                                                "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                                "text": "Here and there the brilliant rays penetrated to earth, but for the most part they only served to accentuate the Stygian blackness of the jungle's depths."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "202cd5f8-c063-4764-8123-2e71f5b1c787",
                                                "sense_id": "a9012c66-f5d7-3725-8708-1f3cd417639b",
                                                "text": "Although the country branch lines may pass, they leave with those who have known them so well an ineffaceable memory[,] and for those who will follow after[,] a memorial in the form of embankment, cutting and tunnel[,] with here and there a station building or railway cottage that time does not destroy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2acf8fde-08d0-3964-8bba-0db8dddcb9c9",
                                        "entry_id": "e53b4e82-54f7-3098-ac7b-3ce75316907f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "From time to time; intermittently, occasionally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11dc6dab-1199-4e80-82e3-3cff1f093167",
                                                "sense_id": "2acf8fde-08d0-3964-8bba-0db8dddcb9c9",
                                                "text": "Before we study his ideas, it is useful to note here again that extraterrestrial powers intervened here and there in his life, as early as his birth, then his baptism […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec1a8d76-39f8-4ce4-8ccb-6b5bd24f9763",
                                                "sense_id": "2acf8fde-08d0-3964-8bba-0db8dddcb9c9",
                                                "text": "Yep. Since nineteen sixty, or thereabouts. Missed a few years, here and there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e100edb8-0ebc-49f1-a006-f849b4a1f355",
                        "source_entry_id": "bdbfb1ef-33a9-3b32-905e-a3ac26f2eacf",
                        "source_sense_id": "f3e9691a-9ec8-35b8-95c6-16fcd867df91",
                        "target_lang_word": "çà et là",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "çà et là",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aacdd909-0a16-34c0-865f-90b9c93673b9",
                                        "entry_id": "f54eab45-453a-3aff-8bd4-7ac1c3d3e732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ici et là ; par-ci par-là ; un peu partout ; à droite à gauche."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f03f857-da40-407c-bedb-fcc86e9d7f79",
                                                "sense_id": "aacdd909-0a16-34c0-865f-90b9c93673b9",
                                                "text": "Sur le bord de ces rivières qui se versent dans ce lac, on trouve en quantité du cuivre natif épars çà et là sur le rivage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07c6b3dc-67b2-4f3d-a92d-4229e24ea050",
                                                "sense_id": "aacdd909-0a16-34c0-865f-90b9c93673b9",
                                                "text": "Quelques arbres, des amandiers, des pruniers et des abricotiers montraient leurs têtes grêles çà et là, dans cet enclos."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d9614a5-80be-4e0d-b8f9-a655fe158ca8",
                                                "sense_id": "aacdd909-0a16-34c0-865f-90b9c93673b9",
                                                "text": "Ça et là, les vignes s'étalaient sur le flanc des collines prochaines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae7c34d6-3427-4535-aae7-25493697cb33",
                                                "sense_id": "aacdd909-0a16-34c0-865f-90b9c93673b9",
                                                "text": "Et c’étaient encore, çà et là, de solennelles et de cocasses définitions telles que celle-ci qui figure dans la vie de César de Bus : […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cab6a976-7bb6-4ba3-88dd-50f81bd42977",
                                                "sense_id": "aacdd909-0a16-34c0-865f-90b9c93673b9",
                                                "text": "La saison fonçait les feuillages, touchait d'or les près, carminait çà et là une branche."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62024b74-68d7-4a43-a333-fd8f77a2612e",
                                                "sense_id": "aacdd909-0a16-34c0-865f-90b9c93673b9",
                                                "text": "Hamhung, deuxième ville du pays, était plongée dans l’obscurité, trouée çà et là par la lueur des lampes à huile dans des appartements."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c56045f9-9abe-47f3-b3df-2d9b9ca13e5a",
                        "source_entry_id": "bdbfb1ef-33a9-3b32-905e-a3ac26f2eacf",
                        "source_sense_id": "f3e9691a-9ec8-35b8-95c6-16fcd867df91",
                        "target_lang_word": "stellenweise",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stellenweise",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2a0bcc3-d292-3d62-8069-9b662e422290",
                                        "entry_id": "073ea317-392b-37d1-b4dd-31cab415d38d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "an einigen Stellen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f64d1e88-1189-4c7a-80d6-dee022685509",
                                                "sense_id": "a2a0bcc3-d292-3d62-8069-9b662e422290",
                                                "text": "Es kann sich stellenweise Bodenfrost bilden."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e9e4568d-0686-4cc2-a36f-5fd5dbb24876",
                        "source_entry_id": "bdbfb1ef-33a9-3b32-905e-a3ac26f2eacf",
                        "source_sense_id": "f3e9691a-9ec8-35b8-95c6-16fcd867df91",
                        "target_lang_word": "изредка",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "изредка",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8997acf-a0c9-314e-9ac3-639496e87209",
                                        "entry_id": "99d69363-8e28-3212-9e1b-46867820e9dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "время от времени, иногда"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea5ff44c-6366-4e8d-a0eb-4e51669f6c86",
                                                "sense_id": "b8997acf-a0c9-314e-9ac3-639496e87209",
                                                "text": "Они шли по Невскому, изредка перекидываясь незначительными фразами."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85d86953-bb8f-4e20-96fd-d26012c99070",
                                                "sense_id": "b8997acf-a0c9-314e-9ac3-639496e87209",
                                                "text": "Пройдет какой-нибудь месяц, и Анна Сергеевна, казалось ему, покроется в памяти туманом и только изредка будет сниться с трогательной улыбкой, как снились другие."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04bbfe09-8d91-3aa6-83e6-5e70b0e6ed2a",
                                        "entry_id": "99d69363-8e28-3212-9e1b-46867820e9dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "кое-где, местами"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6af985f-afb1-40d8-877e-2204086520eb",
                                                "sense_id": "04bbfe09-8d91-3aa6-83e6-5e70b0e6ed2a",
                                                "text": "Изредка попадавшиеся камешки с дыркой он назвал «куриный бог»."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25c9cbef-fea2-4641-a88b-7eedefe963ab",
                                                "sense_id": "04bbfe09-8d91-3aa6-83e6-5e70b0e6ed2a",
                                                "text": "Обрывы изредка разрывались узкими и крутыми промоинами, по которым можно было пешком, а иногда и верхом, выбраться на поверхность пустыни."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d546de7a-b901-426c-901b-4d8509f4b138",
                        "source_entry_id": "bdbfb1ef-33a9-3b32-905e-a3ac26f2eacf",
                        "source_sense_id": "f3e9691a-9ec8-35b8-95c6-16fcd867df91",
